{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30416","headline":"三像寺酬元秘书 · 赵嘏","name":"三像寺酬元秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官总芸香阁署崇，可怜诗句落春风。\n偶然侍坐水声里，还许醉吟松影中。\n车马照来红树合，烟霞咏尽翠微空。\n不因高寺闲回首，谁识飘飘一塞翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}